            %p#ComplexOrientationOfEvenCohomologyTheories
              A sufficient condition for this is, evidently, that the reduced
              = succeed "-cohomology" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi E
